<body>
<div class="card">

<div class="meta">
  <div class="badge">JL-072 · ¥19.9</div>
  <h1>JL-072 秘酱炸鸡酱</h1>
  <div class="sub">韩式炸鸡酱 · 摆摊 ✅ 炸鸡店 ✅ 家庭 ✅</div>
  <div class="tags">
    <span>低门槛</span>
    <span>高复购</span>
    <span>伴手</span>
    <span>适合搭配炸鸡</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="level-banner">
  <span class="level-item high">推荐 ★★★★★</span>
  <span class="level-item med">新手可做</span>
  <span class="level-item med">回本快</span>
  <span class="level-item med">利润稳</span>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">发现这款产品</div>
  <div class="story">
    延边有个朝鲜族阿姨做的秘酱炸鸡特别有名。她的酱叫「秘酱」，是因为用了朝鲜族传统大酱（类似日本的味噌）做底，加上辣椒酱、蒜泥、姜汁、蜂蜜和芝麻调出来的。这个味道非常特别——大酱的发酵鲜味和辣椒的辣、蜂蜜的甜、芝麻的香融合在一起，是一种复合的「酱香型」炸鸡味。<br><br>阿姨说她这个秘酱是从她妈妈那里学来的，最早是用来拌冷面的，后来发现配炸鸡更好吃。大酱在发酵过程中产生的氨基酸和炸鸡的油脂相遇，会产生一种很鲜美的口感。这个酱比普通的韩式甜辣酱更有深度——不是单纯的甜辣，而是「鲜—辣—甜—香」四层味道。<br><br><em>秘酱炸鸡酱的本质是「发酵酱」——用朝鲜族大酱或日本味噌做底，加上其他配料调制。发酵酱的鲜味是任何调味料都无法替代的，这种天然的鲜味和炸鸡搭配，形成了「越吃越鲜」的味觉循环。而且秘酱的成本不高，大酱本身很便宜，适合批量生产。</em>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">项目指数</div>
  <div class="index-grid">
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">轻资产</div><div class="num">★★★★★</div><div class="desc">投入约250元</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">难度</div><div class="num">★★★☆☆</div><div class="desc">2天学会</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">利润</div><div class="num">★★★★★</div><div class="desc">65%毛利率</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">复购</div><div class="num">★★★★★</div><div class="desc">发酵鲜味上瘾</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">成本利润</div>
  <div class="cost-box">
    <div class="row"><span>卖价（100g/份）</span><span class="v">12元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>成本（批量调制）</span><span class="v">约4元/份</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>单份利润</span><span class="v" style="color:#C0392B">约8元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销30份日利润</span><span class="v">240元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销50份日利润</span><span class="v">400元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销80份日利润</span><span class="v">640元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>月固定开销</span><span class="v">约300元</span></div>
    <div class="row tot"><span>设备投入</span><span class="v">约250元</span></div>
  </div>
  <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#3a322a;margin-top:6px">回本周期</div>
  <div class="roi">
    <div class="roi-b c"><div>保守</div><div class="d">3天</div><div>日销30份</div></div>
    <div class="roi-b n"><div>正常</div><div class="d">2天</div><div>日销50份</div></div>
    <div class="roi-b i"><div>理想</div><div class="d">1天</div><div>日销80份</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">项目风险</div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>保存期限</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">冷藏20天，需密封</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>大酱品质</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">不同品牌大酱咸度不同</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>口味认知</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">发酵酱味不是人人都懂</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>制作周期</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">需要静置入味</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">启动清单</div>
  <div class="launch">
        <span>不锈钢锅（小号）60元</span>
    <span>密封罐（10个）40元</span>
    <span>电子秤 30元</span>
    <span>捣蒜器 10元</span>
    <span>硅胶刮刀 15元</span>
    <span>标签贴纸 10元</span>
    <span>一次性酱料杯 0.3元/个</span>
    <span>不锈钢打蛋器 15元</span>
  </div>
  <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;color:#5a4f44">
    <span><strong>总投入：</strong>约250元</span>
    <span><strong>占地：</strong>1m台面</span>
    <span><strong>人员：</strong>1人</span>
    <span><strong>上手：</strong>2天</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">适合场景</div>
  <div class="scene-grid">
        <span class="scene-item">炸鸡摊</span>
    <span class="scene-item">朝鲜族餐厅</span>
    <span class="scene-item">家庭厨房</span>
    <span class="scene-item">外卖档口</span>
    <span class="scene-item">夜宵排档</span>
    <span class="scene-item">延边小吃店</span>
    <span class="scene-item">美食节</span>
    <span class="scene-item">超市柜台</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">搭配销售</div>
  <div class="dpair">
        <div class="dpair-item"><div class="name">秘酱炸鸡</div><div class="price">18-25元/份</div></div>
    <div class="dpair-item"><div class="name">秘酱鸡翅</div><div class="price">15-18元/份</div></div>
    <div class="dpair-item"><div class="name">秘酱拌饭</div><div class="price">10元/份</div></div>
    <div class="dpair-item"><div class="name">泡菜</div><div class="price">5元/份</div></div>
  </div>
  <div style="font-size:11px;color:#7a7269;margin-top:6px">秘酱炸鸡配泡菜是最正宗的朝鲜族吃法，一酱一菜搭配绝佳</div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">对标项目 & 竞争优势</div>
  <div class="comp">
        <div class="comp-item"><span>韩式甜辣酱</span><span class="tag adv">大酱鲜味</span><span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0">甜辣酱只有甜辣，秘酱有大酱发酵的复合鲜味</span></div>
    <div class="comp-item"><span>日式味噌酱</span><span class="tag adv">朝鲜族风味</span><span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0">味噌酱偏清淡，朝鲜族大酱更浓郁更适合炸鸡</span></div>
    <div class="comp-item"><span>超市炸鸡酱</span><span class="tag adv">手工发酵</span><span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0">超市酱用添加剂调鲜，我用天然大酱发酵提鲜</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">销售话术</div>
  <div class="copy-box">
    「哥，尝尝秘酱炸鸡，<em>用朝鲜族大酱调的，那种发酵的鲜味超市买不到</em>。」<br>
    「这个酱不是普通的甜辣味，你仔细品，有大酱的鲜、蜂蜜的甜、芝麻的香。」<br>
    「延边那边就这么吃炸鸡的，配点泡菜更地道。」<br>
    「秘酱炸鸡套餐，鸡+秘酱+泡菜一份22块，尝尝不一样的炸鸡。」
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">避坑指南</div>
    <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 大酱必须提前用料酒澥开——大酱质地很稠很咸，直接和其他材料混合会结块不均匀。先用料酒或清水把大酱澥成糊状，再和其他材料调和</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 大酱和辣椒酱的比例是1:1——大酱太多会发咸，失去辣椒酱的甜辣感；辣椒酱太多就变成了普通的甜辣酱，失去大酱的发酵鲜味</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 调好的秘酱要静置冷藏4小时以上——刚调好的秘酱各种味道还没有融合，大酱的咸味和辣椒酱的甜味是分离的。静置4小时后，味道才会完全融合，口感更圆润</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 不要用廉价大酱——便宜大酱是用豆粕发酵的，鲜味不足还有豆腥味。要用传统工艺的朝鲜族大酱或日本味噌，至少发酵6个月以上的产品</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ 炸鸡裹秘酱前要稍微放凉——秘酱中的大酱在高温下会变稀，刷在热炸鸡上容易往下淌。炸鸡出锅后凉2分钟再刷酱，酱的挂壁效果最好</div>
</div>

<div class="pay">
